#: koassistant/books/book_settings.lua:4156
msgid ""
"Each kind of data has a value for all books (the Global tab, also Settings → "
"Privacy & Data), and a book can have its own (For this book), or follow a "
"group's (Group Settings → Privacy & Data). Ask means KOAssistant asks the "
"first time an action wants it, and \"Allow for this book\" in that question "
"sets Allow here. Never wins over everything, trusted providers included. "
"Allow lets the data go without a question; actions still take only the kinds "
"they declare. Allowing annotation notes allows highlights; Never for "
"highlights is Never for notes.\n"
"\n"
"Book info is not asked: it is what the AI is told about the book with every "
"request (the title, the author, your position). None sends nothing that "
"names the book."
