"'When it fits' shows the popup only when the whole response fits inside it; "
"longer responses open the full window directly. 'Always' shows the popup for "
"any response; one that is too long scrolls inside it (swipe up or down, or "
"use the page-turn keys). Streaming is skipped for these requests. Never "
"applies to full-page translation."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1834
msgid "Popup Style"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1838
msgid "Floating box (near the selection)"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1841
msgid ""
