"is as wide as the chat window. The footnote panel sits at the bottom of the "
"screen from edge to edge, like KOReader's footnote popups. Either one is as "
"tall as the response needs, up to about half the screen."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1851
msgid "Actions Using Minimal Popup: %1"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1854
